# Vastra — Technical Architecture & Implementation Plan

## Goal

Build a production-grade tailoring marketplace with **3 interfaces** (customer web, mobile app, admin panel) and a shared backend, achievable as a college project.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| **Backend** | Node.js + Express.js | Fast to build, huge ecosystem, great for REST APIs |
| **Database** | MongoDB + Mongoose | Flexible schema, free Atlas tier, easy for prototyping |
| **Auth** | JWT + bcrypt + OTP (via email) | Industry-standard, no vendor lock-in |
| **File Storage** | Cloudinary (free tier) | Image upload, transformation, CDN delivery — 25GB free |
| **Payments** | Razorpay (test mode) | Indian payment gateway, excellent docs, test mode for project |
| **Real-time** | Socket.io | In-app chat messaging |
| **Web Frontend** | Next.js (React) | SSR for SEO, file-based routing, production-ready |
| **Mobile App** | React Native (Expo) | Cross-platform, shares JS ecosystem with backend/web |
| **Admin Panel** | Next.js (separate app) | Reuse React knowledge, separate deployment |
| **Deployment** | Vercel (web) + Render (backend) | Free tiers, zero DevOps |

> [!NOTE]
> All these services have **free tiers** sufficient for a college project demo.

---

