## API Design (RESTful)

### Auth
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register (customer/tailor) |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login → JWT |
| POST | `/api/auth/forgot-password` | Send reset email |
| POST | `/api/auth/reset-password` | Reset password |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user |

### Tailors
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tailors` | List/search/filter tailors |
| GET | `/api/tailors/:id` | Tailor public profile |
| PUT | `/api/tailors/profile` | Update own profile (tailor) |
| POST | `/api/tailors/portfolio` | Upload portfolio image |
| DELETE | `/api/tailors/portfolio/:imageId` | Remove portfolio image |

### Products
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/products` | Browse product catalog |
| GET | `/api/products/:id` | Product details + design options |

### Orders
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/orders` | Place order |
| GET | `/api/orders` | My orders (customer or tailor) |
| GET | `/api/orders/:id` | Order details |
| PATCH | `/api/orders/:id/status` | Update status (tailor) |
| PATCH | `/api/orders/:id/quote` | Send price quote (tailor) |
| POST | `/api/orders/:id/pay` | Initiate Razorpay payment |
| POST | `/api/orders/:id/verify-payment` | Verify Razorpay callback |

### Reviews
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/reviews` | Create review |
| GET | `/api/reviews/tailor/:tailorId` | Get tailor's reviews |
| PUT | `/api/reviews/:id` | Edit own review |
| DELETE | `/api/reviews/:id` | Delete own review |

### Messages (REST + Socket.io)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/messages/:orderId` | Chat history for an order |
| POST | `/api/messages` | Send message (also via socket) |

### Measurements
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/measurements` | My saved profiles |
| POST | `/api/measurements` | Save new profile |
| PUT | `/api/measurements/:id` | Update profile |
| GET | `/api/measurements/template/:garmentType` | Get measurement template |

### Admin
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/admin/users` | All users |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/users/:id` | Activate/ban user |
| GET | `/api/admin/tailors/pending` | Pending verifications |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/tailors/:id/verify` | Approve/reject tailor |
| GET | `/api/admin/orders` | All orders |
| GET | `/api/admin/disputes` | All disputes |
| PATCH | `/api/admin/disputes/:id` | Resolve dispute / issue refund |
| GET | `/api/admin/reviews/flagged` | Flagged reviews |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/reviews/:id` | Remove review |
| CRUD | `/api/admin/products` | Manage product catalog |
| GET | `/api/admin/settings` | Platform settings |
| PUT | `/api/admin/settings` | Update settings |

---

## Web Pages (Next.js App Router)

| Page | Route | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Home | `/` | Hero, featured tailors, categories, how-it-works |
| Browse Products | `/products` | Product grid with filters |
| Product Detail | `/products/[id]` | Design options, "Find a tailor" |
| Browse Tailors | `/tailors` | Search, filter, map view |
| Tailor Profile | `/tailors/[id]` | Full profile, portfolio, reviews, order CTA |
| Place Order | `/order/new?tailor=[id]` | Multi-step order form |
| My Orders | `/dashboard/orders` | Customer order list |
| Order Detail | `/dashboard/orders/[id]` | Status, chat, payment |
| My Measurements | `/dashboard/measurements` | Saved profiles |
| Messages | `/dashboard/messages` | Chat threads |
| Tailor Dashboard | `/tailor/dashboard` | Tailor home (stats) |
| Tailor Orders | `/tailor/orders` | Incoming & active orders |
| Tailor Profile Edit | `/tailor/profile` | Edit profile & portfolio |
| Auth | `/login`, `/register` | Login & signup pages |

---

## Mobile Screens (React Native)

Mirrors web pages with mobile-native navigation:
- Bottom tabs: Home, Search, Orders, Messages, Profile
- Stack navigation within each tab

